Hi, this is pemkarni! pemkarni is a weekly magazine publishing your poems.

I encourage *everyone*, even beginners, to try writing a poem and enforcing
their skills. I'll be proposing corrections, so no worries if you got
something wrong.

As for the mailing list, even though Reddit has a smaller audience, 80% of
submissions come from it. Please, make the mailing list a place of
Lojbanists ready to act!

Now, here's the link:

http://wp.me/p7SlMg-k

Have fun! ~ uakci

